ack in man of steel we see superman in  the black suit again  fighting what appears to be steppenwolf  most importantly we see what looks like  a different version of clark's reunion  with lois and martha  after his resurrection you remembered  this is home if there's one thing that  snyder cut fans have been absolutely  frothing over  it's the reinsertion of justice league's  big bad dark side  and he's not the only villain we see in  this trailer but  yes to get it out of the way the very  first face we see in the snyder cut  justice league trailer  is darkseids we've heard a lot about  time travel being a part of this new cut  of the story  and it looks like we'll be seeing one  future where darkseid destroys the earth  within the first 15 seconds of the  trailer we get a glimpse of what appears  to be a destroyed justice league  headquarters  parademons swarm towards what remains of  an obliterated city  as spaceships rain fire down on the last  of what was human civilization  we also get a shot of the updated  steppenwolf in full armor  as well as our first glimpse of  darkseid's right-hand man  dassan who appears in a hooded cloak  that's everything we've seen so far  we have not however glimpsed any sign of  martian manhunter  lex luthor or the green lantern corps  but you wouldn't want everything given  away in a single trailer  would you check out one of our newest  videos right here plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite stuff are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

